%N A401458 Number of fixed points under iteration of the function S(x) = n+sum of squares of digits of x.
%H A401458 B. Baker Swart, K. Beck, S. Crook, C. Eubanks-Turner, H. Grundman, M. Mei, and L. Zack, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1216/RMJ-2017-47-2-403">Augmented generalized happy functions</a>, Rocky Mountain J. Math., 47 (2017), 403-417.
