%H A401458 Sean A. Irvine, <a href="https://github.com/archmageirvine/joeis/blob/master/src/irvine/oeis/a401/A401458.java">Java program</a> (github)
%e A401458 For n=1, S(35)=1+3^2+5^2=35 and S(75)=1+7^2+5^2=75. These are the only two fixed points of S. So a(1) = 2.
